# --- LangChain (new architecture) ---
# Upper-bounded below the 1.0 line (2026-08-05): langchain 1.x is a breaking
# rearchitecture — mixing it with the pre-1.0 langchain-core API (which this
# codebase's LLM-init code still uses) crashes at startup with
# `AttributeError: module 'langchain' has no attribute 'verbose'`. An
# unbounded range let a fresh install silently pick up 1.x and break.
